{
  "name": "SOC SOAR - SOC Server + Ollama + Telegram + pfSense",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SOC SOAR - n8n orchestration\n\nSOC Server la noi luu alert, case, audit va quan ly Agent.\nn8n chi lam AI triage, human approval, pfSense response va notification.\n\nDa loai bo: Wazuh, TheHive, MISP.\nGiu lai: Ollama, Telegram, SSH pfSense.\n\nWebhook: POST /webhook/soc-alert\nCallback: POST /api/v1/soar/callback\n\nTODO threat-intel: SOC Server chua co GET /api/v1/ioc/lookup va route indicators yeu cau JWT, nen workflow khong gia lap enrichment.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, -300],
      "id": "note-overview",
      "name": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CAN CAU HINH\n\n1. Telegram credential va chatId\n2. SSH credential vao pfSense\n3. URL Ollama\n4. URL SOC Server trong node Callback\n5. Tao table SOAR_BlockList tren pfSense\n6. Tao DNSBL file tren pfSense neu dung block_url\n\nKhong de AI tao shell command. Command duoc sinh boi Code node sau khi da approve.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -300],
      "id": "note-setup",
      "name": "Setup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "soc-alert",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [-520, 120],
      "id": "webhook-soc-alert",
      "name": "SOC Server Alert Webhook",
      "webhookId": "soc-server-alert-webhook-2026"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const incoming = $json.body || $json;\nlet raw = incoming.raw_payload || {};\nif (typeof raw === 'string') { try { raw = JSON.parse(raw); } catch { raw = {}; } }\n\nconst severity = String(incoming.severity || 'medium').toLowerCase();\nconst eventType = String(incoming.event_type || 'unknown').toLowerCase();\nconst sourceIp = incoming.src_ip || incoming.source_ip || raw.src_ip || raw.srcip || '';\nconst processId = String(incoming.process_id || raw.process_id || raw.pid || raw.process?.pid || '');\nconst url = incoming.url || raw.url || '';\nconst domain = incoming.domain || raw.domain || '';\n\nreturn { json: {\n  alert_id: incoming.alert_id || `n8n-${Date.now()}`,\n  agent_id: incoming.agent_id || incoming.agent?.id || '',\n  event_type: eventType,\n  severity,\n  title: incoming.title || 'SOC Security Alert',\n  description: incoming.description || incoming.message || '',\n  src_ip: sourceIp,\n  process_id: processId,\n  url,\n  domain,\n  timestamp: incoming.timestamp || new Date().toISOString(),\n  raw_payload: raw\n} };"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-280, 120],
      "id": "normalize-alert",
      "name": "Normalize SOC Alert"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { model: 'gemma3:4b', stream: false, format: 'json', options: { temperature: 0, num_ctx: 4096 }, prompt: 'Ban la SOC analyst. Phan tich alert va chi tra ve JSON thuần. Action chi duoc la block_ip, kill_process, block_url, create_case, ignore. Khong tao shell command. Neu thieu du lieu thi chon create_case. Dữ liệu alert: ' + JSON.stringify($json) } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [0, 120],
      "id": "ollama-analysis",
      "name": "Ollama AI Triage"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const alert = $('Normalize SOC Alert').item.json;\nlet ai = {};\ntry { ai = typeof $json.response === 'string' ? JSON.parse($json.response) : ($json.response || $json); } catch { ai = {}; }\n\nconst allowed = ['block_ip', 'kill_process', 'block_url', 'create_case', 'ignore'];\nlet action = allowed.includes(ai.action) ? ai.action : 'create_case';\nconst confidence = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, Number(ai.confidence) || 0));\n\nif (action === 'block_ip' && !alert.src_ip) action = 'create_case';\nif (action === 'kill_process' && (!alert.process_id || !alert.agent_id)) action = 'create_case';\nif (action === 'block_url' && !alert.domain && !alert.url) action = 'create_case';\n\nreturn { json: {\n  ...alert,\n  action,\n  ai_used: true,\n  ai_verdict: ai.verdict || 'unknown',\n  ai_confidence: confidence,\n  reason: ai.reason || 'AI khong cung cap ly do hop le.',\n  requires_approval: ['block_ip', 'kill_process', 'block_url'].includes(action)\n} };"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [250, 120],
      "id": "build-decision",
      "name": "Build Safe Decision"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendAndWait",
        "chatId": "5407528909",
        "message": "=🚨 YEU CAU PHE DUYET SOC\n\nAlert: {{ $json.alert_id }}\nEvent: {{ $json.event_type }}\nSeverity: {{ $json.severity }}\nAgent: {{ $json.agent_id || 'N/A' }}\n\nAction: {{ $json.action }}\nTarget: {{ $json.src_ip || $json.process_id || $json.domain || $json.url || 'N/A' }}\nAI confidence: {{ $json.ai_confidence }}\nLy do: {{ $json.reason }}\n\nChap nhan hanh dong thay doi he thong?",
        "approvalOptions": { "values": { "approvalType": "double" } },
        "options": { "limitWaitTime": { "values": { "resumeAmount": 10, "resumeUnit": "minutes" } } }
      },
